{"ID":"20240515131449-0b03g1a","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240515131449-0b03g1a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131449-0b03g1a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132757-fetwpae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132757-fetwpae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:703,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132757-fetwpae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:569,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:586\u0026#125;","title":"012","type":"doc","updated":"20240515150311"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515132757-fetwpae","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1000px;","id":"20240515132757-fetwpae","updated":"20240515150311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：1999/11/10"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名BW 性别男"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血壓高 280/120。 頭痛。雙肋痛(外側)。右側環跳痛(切片後)延足少陽膽經上下。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口：不大, 因一直噁心。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你血壓高時有何不適？答：有時會嘔吐, 如心臟要跳出。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫度：雙足冷且麻木。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身溫：無身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：口渴重, 喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出汗：不易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便 : 淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：平平。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 睡眠：失眠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白濕厚。→主寒濕，此乃典型的腎臟不好之舌象(快腎衰竭了)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔無反應, 肝區有褐點。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心陽不足 腎陽虛 陰不入腎。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： 左(俠溪, 申脈),  雙(足三里 , 太衝)。左束骨, 右環跳(呼吸補法, 不留針)。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 生附子三錢 乾薑二錢  炙甘草五錢桂枝五錢 白术五錢  澤瀉五錢 茯苓五錢 豬苓三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢  補骨脂三錢白芍八錢  炮附子四錢 川芎三錢  柴胡三錢 鬱金五錢 龍膽草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗 →3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各服 1碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1生附子 乾薑  炙甘草→四逆湯→壯心陽"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2桂枝 白术 澤瀉 茯苓 豬苓→五苓散→利濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3柴胡 鬱金 龍膽草 →清肝助睡眠"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4白芍  炙甘草 炮附子 川芎→ 芍藥甘草附子湯→雙足冷且麻木"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5補骨脂 澤瀉→補腎陽"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6豬苓利下焦水，患者小便還通時就不用，若欲強攻腎臟與膀胱積水時就重用"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 此人對西藥過敏, 故無法吃降壓藥。"}]}]}]}]}